        </div>


        <div class="publication">

            <span class="publication-number">13.</span>

            <h3>
                Development of High-performance Polymer Electrolyte
                Membranes through the Application of Quantum Dot Coatings
                to Nafion Membranes.
            </h3>

            <p class="journal">
                ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces, 2023, 15, 15616–15624.
            </p>

